      },
      "content": "Two machinist's levels"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0328",
      "reading_order": 379,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 153.0,
        "t": 730.04827,
        "r": 273.15999999999985,
        "b": 718.80827
      },
      "content": "Baseplate-leveling worksheet"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0329",
      "reading_order": 380,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 712.04827,
        "r": 538.4500000000004,
        "b": 700.80827
      },
      "content": "This procedure is applicable to the feature-fabricated steel baseplate and the advantage base baseplate."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0330",
      "reading_order": 381,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 697.39233,
        "r": 352.7399999999999,
        "b": 686.15233
      },
      "content": "Apply an anti-seize compound on the jackscrews."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0331",
      "reading_order": 382,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99996,
        "t": 682.8723299999999,
        "r": 427.8899600000001,
        "b": 671.63233
      },
      "content": "The compound makes it easier to remove the screws after you grout."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0332",
      "reading_order": 383,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 143.99996,
        "t": 669.2787599999999,
        "r": 475.25996000000015,
        "b": 658.03876
      },
      "content": "Lower the baseplate carefully onto the foundation bolts and perform these steps:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0333",
      "reading_order": 384,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99994,
        "t": 654.6228199999999,
        "r": 541.2499400000002,
        "b": 631.38282
      },
      "content": "Cut the plates from the bar stock and chamfer the edges of  the plates in order to reduce stress concentrations."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0334",
      "reading_order": 385,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99991,
        "t": 629.29485,
        "r": 430.23991,
        "b": 618.05485
      },
      "content": "Put the plates between the jackscrews and the foundation surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0335",
      "reading_order": 386,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99991,
        "t": 615.96688,
        "r": 549.9998900000004,
        "b": 578.20688
      },
      "content": "Use the four jackscrews in the corners in order to raise the baseplate above the foundation. Make sure that the distance between the baseplate and the foundation surface is between 0.75 in. (19 mm) and 1.50 in. (38 mm)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0336",
      "reading_order": 387,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99984,
        "t": 576.1189099999999,
        "r": 476.3398400000002,
        "b": 564.87891
      },
      "content": "Make sure that the center jackscrews do not touch the foundation surface yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0337",
      "reading_order": 388,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99905,
        "t": 411.94822999999997,
        "r": 217.33505000000002,
        "b": 403.02022999999997
      },
      "content": "Jackscrew"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0338",
      "reading_order": 389,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99905,
        "t": 402.94822999999997,
        "r": 215.57505000000003,
        "b": 394.02022999999997
      },
      "content": "Baseplate"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0339",
      "reading_order": 390,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99905,
        "t": 393.94822999999997,
        "r": 220.02305000000004,
        "b": 385.02022999999997
      },
      "content": "Foundation"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0340",
      "reading_order": 391,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99905,
        "t": 384.94822999999997,
        "r": 198.23105,
        "b": 376.02022999999997
      },
      "content": "Plate"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0341",
      "reading_order": 392,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.00105,
        "t": 371.64117,
        "r": 285.14104999999995,
        "b": 360.40117
      },
      "content": "Level the driver mounting pads:"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0032",
      "reading_order": 393,
      "section": "Install the baseplate using jackscrews",
      "bbox": {
